      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Milestone 5 - Follow-Up Automation\n\nBusiness rule:\n- AI-classified `quote_request` leads are scheduled for follow-up 24 hours later.\n- This workflow checks once per hour.\n- Due leads are claimed exactly once by FastAPI.\n- A durable follow-up task event is created.\n- Staff receives an internal notification.\n- A customer follow-up message is prepared and preserved in the execution log.\n\nFor a portfolio demo, use **Manual Demo Trigger** after moving a synthetic quote lead's `follow_up_at` into the past.\n\nLocal requirements:\n- FastAPI on `127.0.0.1:8000`\n- n8n running locally\n- Milestone 5 backend patch applied\n",
